  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Heart Catch — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At 18th level, you have learned the true meaning of love. At initiative 20 all creatures in the Domain are restrained and charmed until the end of their next turn. Additionally, your Love Hands automatically hit all attack rolls and creatures automatically fail grapple and shove checks as well as saving throws made by the hands.</p>",
